<title>HUNGARY: Hungary November CPI up 0.8 percent - Stats Office.</title>
<headline>Hungary November CPI up 0.8 percent - Stats Office.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's consumer prices rose 0.8 percent in November compared with October and 20.1 percent compared with November 1995, the Central Statistical Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY CONSUMER PRICE INDEX (CPI)</p>
<p>				Nov '96    Oct '96    Nov 95</p>
<p>Month-on-month (pct)    +0.8	 +1.4	 +1.6</p>
<p>Year-on-year (pct)     +20.1	+21.0	+28.7</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
